ame><surname>Hohl</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kartasova</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name><name><surname>Jarnik</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Steven</surname><given-names>A.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Roop</surname><given-names>D.R.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Lessons for loricrin-deficient micecompensatory mechanisms maintaining skin barrier function in the absence of a major cornified envelope protein</article-title><source>J. Cell Biol.</source><volume>151</volume><year>2000</year><fpage>389</fpage><lpage>400</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11038185</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Korgeetal1997"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Korge</surname><given-names>B.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishida-Yamamoto</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Punter</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Dopping-Hepenstal</surname><given-names>P.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Iizuka</surname><given-names>H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Stephenson</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Eady</surname><given-names>R.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Munro</surname><given-names>C.S.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Loricrin mutation in Vohwinkel's keratoderma is unique to the variant with ichthyosis</article-title><source>J. Invest. Dermatol</source><volume>109</volume><year>1997</year><fpage>604</fpage><lpage>610</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9326398</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="Maestrinietal1996"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maestrini</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Monaco</surname><given-names>A.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>McGrath</surname><given-names>J.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishida-Yamamoto</su